WEBVTT

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:08.480
The White Blood Cells struggled badly
in the gonococci battle,

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.400
drastically thinning their ranks.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:17.240
Right now, no one can save this world
but you Killer T Cells!

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.830
<i>Helper T Cells.</i>

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.120
<i>When notified of invading external enemies,</i>

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.170
<i>they serve as commanders who formulate
appropriate attack strategies,</i>

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.170
<i>and they issue orders to Killer T Cells.</i>

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.630
CELL

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.630
Foreign substance sighted.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.840
<i>Killer T Cells.</i>

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.600
<i>Deployed on the orders of a Helper T Cell.</i>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.810
<i>Professional killers who recognize
and destroy foreign substances,</i>

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:43.980
<i>such as virus-infected cells
and Cancer Cells.</i>

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.190
It's time for you to show
the cells residing here

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:51.940
as well as the foolish viruses
who dare throw down the gauntlet...

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:58.120
Show them that we T Cells
are the most powerful of all!

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:01.200
Work!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:42.760
EPISODE 5:
OVERWORK, HAIR LOSS,
AND DELIRIUM

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.760
Here's today's oxygen. Stamp this, please.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.470
There you go.
Thanks for your hard work.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:45.470
RECEIVED

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.640
Thank you very much.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.190
- Hey, hold up a second.
- Yes?

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:52.770
Is it just me,
or are you looking more manly lately?

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.520
Huh? You really think so?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:58.490
Oh my! Seems to me like you're even looking
more gallant than before!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:04.450
Well, lately, I've been starting to feel
a little more confident about my job.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.490
What are you talking about?

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.410
I hate to break it to you,
but I'm still not getting nearly enough oxygen!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.460
So keep 'em coming, got that?

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.040
R-Right!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.010
So, this is a hair root.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.140
<i>Hair root.</i>

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:32.480
<i>The part of a hair embedded under the skin.
The tissue where hair is developed.</i>

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.940
I've come to deliver your oxygen!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.780
Hey, thanks for your hard work.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.320
Okay, if you could put
one of them down over there...

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.400
Sure!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.160
And just leave the other one over there.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.160
U-Uh, right.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.380
Did we surprise you?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:03.760
We Hair Matrix Cells make hair
by dividing over and over.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.720
<i>Hair Matrix Cells.</i>

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:12.810
<i>They receive nutrients and oxygen from the
hair papilla, and divide to produce hair.</i>

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.020
Even if he's sick or burdened with stress,

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.150
we still have to keep producing hair
on a constant basis.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.280
It sure sounds like a tough job.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.740
Hey, it's what we know.
From where I stand...

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:28.450
delivering oxygen day in and day out
like you guys seems a lot tougher.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.910
Pigment Cell! This part's still white!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:36.880
Oh, sorry about that!
I'll be right there.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.300
<i>Pigment Cell.</i>

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:46.930
<i>Also known as melanin, this cell produces
the pigment that hair color is based on.</i>

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.520
There are all kinds of jobs in this world.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:55.100
All right! Let's go!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.240
White Blood Cell...

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.830
It's distracting to be watched.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.540
S-Sorry!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:23.130
You still haven't healed up yet.
Are you sure you should be exercising so hard?

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:26.260
This is nothing. It's rehab for me.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.760
It's just not in my nature to sit still.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.100
But...

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:36.600
The gonococci battle left the White Blood Cells
short-handed. I have to get back into action soon.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:41.110
Well, please don't overdo it.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.730
Right.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.240
I guess I'll be on my way now.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.950
Come to think of it,

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.950
you really helped me out the other day.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.660
What you said really saved me.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:58.580
<i>Pus is proof that White Blood Cells
fought with their lives on the line!</i>

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:05.090
<i>Even if others fear them and find fault with them,
they never say a word of complaint.</i>

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:11.260
<i>They go on fighting for this body. For us cells.
It's proof that White Blood Cell fought for us!</i>

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.010
<i>So, how could it be dirty?</i>

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:19.100
Thanks to you,
I was able to fight to the end. Thanks.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.060
O-Oh, hey, please!

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:28.280
Just watching you and the other cells fight so hard
in this deplorable code black environment

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:32.070
made me realize that I have to give it
my all, too! That's why...

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:37.790
Wait, sorry if I sound arrogant!
All I want to say is...

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.500
let's keep working together
to build a great world!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:43.460
Yeah.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.420
Let's do that.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.470
LYMPHATIC VESSEL

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.230
Someone's having a good time, I see.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:06.230
Thanks to that pathetic fight you White Blood Cells
put up against the gonococci,

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.610
we have to go into battle
every single day now.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:13.910
You don't have to be that way! White Blood Cell
put everything on the line to fight hard—

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.080
It's all right.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.290
There's no question that we're putting
a lot of strain on the Killer T Cells.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.250
So, it's not lost on you, then.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:27.710
Whoops! We don't have time to chat
with a useless cell like you. Let's go.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.850
White Blood Cell...

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.140
Don't look at me like that.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.770
No matter what anyone says to me,
as long as there's peace in this world, it's all good.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:46.110
I'm just going to do what I can do
for the sake of that peace. That's all.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.690
I guess you're right.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:55.780
Invasion of foreign substance in the blood vessels
near the nasal cavity detected!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.540
Send out the Killer T Cells now!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:03.250
But they just returned from that battle
with the virus-infected cells.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:07.460
After fighting on consecutive days,
the Killer T Cells' exhaustion is building up.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.670
Maybe you could at least request backup
from the White Blood Cells and Macrophages—

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.630
There's no need for that!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:17.560
The Killer T Cells
are the Lymphocytes' elite forces!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.930
This body's last line of defense
against outside enemies.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.940
Even if they're suffering
from built-up fatigue,

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:28.320
this is a golden opportunity for them to
flex their muscles as the all-powerful T Cells!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:35.030
As long as a foreign substance exists
in this world, our job is to eliminate it! That's it—

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.740
Are you all right?

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.160
Commander Helper T,
you should get some rest, too.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.370
Shut up! Don't order me around!

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.870
To fight as long as we're able to...

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.880
it's for the sake of this world!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.750
Mobilize, Killer T Cells!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:54.680
Eliminate, eliminate, eliminate, eliminate
those foreign substances out of existence!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:00.260
If push comes to shove,
we've got an ace-in-the-hole.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.140
PLATELETS

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:06.980
Eliminate the foreign substances.
Eliminate the foreign substances.

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:13.860
Eliminate the foreign substances.
Eliminate the foreign substances.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:17.620
The Killer T Cells aren't like their usual selves.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.410
They were kind of scary!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:24.120
Huh? Those Killer T Cells
always had scary faces!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.080
But it seemed like something
was goading them on.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.340
Don't worry about other cells!
Just work!

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.050
- Okay.
- Okay.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.890
Did you hear? Thanks to the Killer T Cells
coming up big again,

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.100
the virus that invaded the nasal cavity
just got destroyed.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.060
Amazing.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:50.360
But doesn't it seem like the Killer T Cells
are being overworked lately?

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:55.030
I'm sure there isn't a single cell in this body
who isn't being overworked.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.320
Here, too, huh?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:01.530
The blood vessel's are clogged up
with bad cholesterol.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:07.120
These days, the circulation in the crown is so bad,
it takes a huge effort to get to the hair roots.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.790
<i>All of you working near the crown...</i>

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.790
<i>This is Helper T Cell.</i>

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:12.920
What's this?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:19.510
There's some ongoing trouble in the crown
at this time, but the Killer T Cells have mobilized.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.180
Sorry to cause you all worry...

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:26.180
<i>but let's do our jobs
to eliminate the enemy without fail!</i>

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.810
Trouble in the crown area?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:31.520
Maybe a potent virus snuck in.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.900
Oh well, if the Killer T Cells are on it,
we should be fine.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.410
I guess so.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:46.370
Hey, this capillary over here looks viable!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:55.880
PORES
HAIR ROOT

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.620
Kinda hot in here, isn't it?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.880
Were the hair roots always like this?

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:55.880
No, I was just here,
and it wasn't like this at all.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.800
Hot!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.050
Wh-What's going on here?

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:06.060
Is this hair root inflamed?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.690
Is this hair root inflamed?

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.490
Help...

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:20.740
us...

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.570
Hair Matrix Cell!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:23.910
Are you all right?

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:30.790
What the heck happened?
Did you get attacked by a germ?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.580
It wasn't a germ or a virus.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.340
Killer T Cell?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.220
Thank goodness!

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:48.060
Please help us! It looks
like Hair Matrix Cell's under attack!

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:49.850
Do something about this, will you?

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.770
Sure, I'll eliminate the foreign substances.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.560
The foreign substances...

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.410
What are you doing, Killer T Cell?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.370
What am I doing?

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.540
Isn't it obvious?

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:12.040
I'm eliminating foreign substances
to protect this body from outside enemies!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.550
That's our job as Killer T Cells!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.050
What's going on here?

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.850
Outside enemies?

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.970
The Hair Matrix Cells are our friends!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.600
Why would you attack a cell
who's on your side?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.190
I-I'm begging you to stop!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.110
What did we ever do to you?

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.650
Out of my way!
Are you a foreign substance, too?

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.910
Pigment Cell! Are you okay?

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.160
What in the world is...

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:53.580
We don't have a clue, either.
There are no outside enemies here.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:57.290
And yet, the Killer T Cells
came out of nowhere, attacking us.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.500
And now, they're destroying this hair root.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.270
The hair is falling out!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:16.100
Oh... The fruits of our labor...

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.520
Please, that's enough, Killer T Cell!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:24.240
Eliminate all foreign substances...
eliminate all foreign substances...

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.950
S-Somebody!
Somebody, please stop them!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.160
Where's Helper T Cell?

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:36.170
The one who gives all the orders...
What's Helper T Cell doing?

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:38.290
Foreign substances must be eliminated...

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.750
Foreign substances must be eliminated!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.340
Hold on a second!
Commander Helper T!

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.930
Is that you, Dendritic Cell?
What do you want?

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.090
<i>Dendritic Cells.</i>

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.600
<i>Their role is to present bacteria
that have invaded the body</i>

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:55.480
<i>and fragments of viral infection cells
as antigens,</i>

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:59.360
<i>and to notify other Immune System Cells.</i>

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.020
Please cease the attack
on the hair root for now!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.320
What did you say?

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.030
There's a chance that you could be attacking
the Hair Matrix Cells right now!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.700
Hair Matrix Cells?
No way in hell!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.740
A cell that divides at that blistering pace...
What else could it be but a Cancer Cell?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:18.540
Don't forget, Hair Matrix Cells
also divide and multiply vigorously.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.330
If you could just check first—

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:22.960
There's no time for that now!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.670
Under these stressful conditions,

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:28.220
letting a single virus or Cancer Cell
slip through would be catastrophic!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:31.680
We have to protect this body!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:35.930
Can you protect it?
Can you carry this weight?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.270
Eliminate all foreign substances!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:42.480
Eradicate all red-flag characters
from this body!

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.400
The hair...

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.820
The hair we created together is falling out.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.910
<i>Spot baldness.</i>

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.410
<i>It's triggered when the body's defenses,
the Killer T Cells,</i>

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:03.170
<i>mistakenly attack the hair root's auto antigens.</i>

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.590
<i>It's an autoimmune disorder.</i>

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:09.550
<i>Causes include psychological stress.</i>

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.590
Please stop!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:14.350
Scurrying around like mice!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.930
Is it you? Are you the Cancer Cell?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.270
I-I'm not!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:19.600
Eliminate!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.060
Nothing's getting through to him at all!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.860
H-He's totally lost it!
Let's get out of here!

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:32.530
<i>No matter what anyone says to me,
as long as there's peace in this world, it's all good.</i>

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:38.540
<i>I'm just going to do what I can do
for the sake of that peace. That's all.</i>

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.630
Let's deliver.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.380
We're going to deliver
as much oxygen as we can!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:49.920
Wh-What are you talking about?
At a time like this?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:54.350
All the more at a time like this!
If we do nothing, all the hair will end up falling out!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:58.060
We're going to deliver oxygen
to the hair root and revitalize it!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:03.350
That's what we can do right now
for the sake of the peace of this world!

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:08.360
What are you doing?
You still haven't wiped out those Cancer Cells?

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.410
We're going to use our ace-in-the-hole.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.030
Ace-in-the-hole?

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.450
We're secreting cytokines
onto the Killer T Cells!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.370
But if you do that—

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.370
Out of my way!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:25.460
We're the strongest cells,
so we can't mess up!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:30.880
We have to wipe out all foreign substances
from this body to protect it!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:35.390
Work, work, work until you drop!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.350
<i>Cytokines.</i>

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:45.730
<i>Substances used to stimulate
or inhibit the actions of Immune Cells.</i>

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:52.070
<i>Helper T Cells use cytokines
to stimulate Killer T Cells.</i>

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:56.370
That's right.
We've got to dig in and fight...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:00.290
To protect this body...
To protect everyone...

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.000
That's our...

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:07.500
That's our job!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:11.020
Hey! This is looking really bad!

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:13.380
There are still some intact hairs over here!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.510
Hey! Did you hear what I said?
That's it! You're on your own now!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.470
Please bring the oxygen here!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.430
Let's protect this hair root together!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.580
<i>We have to do the job that we can do!</i>

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:47.290
<i>To work like our lives depend on it,
to protect this body...</i>

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:50.250
<i>we have to deliver this oxygen!</i>

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.840
That's it. That's what I like to see.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:57.050
Work! For the sake of this body!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:02.680
<i>Killer T Cell's just seeing his own job
through to the end, that's all!</i>

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:06.190
<i>For this world, for us all...</i>

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:09.230
<i>So, how... How did he end up like this?</i>

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.150
Hey, help!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:12.530
What's that?

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:16.110
I don't know! When I tried to make a run for it,
a whole bunch came tumbling in!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.870
<i>We have arrived at our target destination.</i>

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.700
Wh-What the heck is that thing?

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.040
<i>Arrived.</i>

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.920
<i>Target cell confirmed.</i>

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.460
<i>Now eliminating.</i>

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.590
- What the cell...
- Stand your ground!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.380
Foreign substances must be eliminated!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:40.970
Crap!

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.980
Wh-What the cell is that?

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:55.070
I found a match in my data!
Those are steroids!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.400
Did you say "steroids"?

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.280
<i>Target cell confirmed.</i>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.450
<i>Now eliminating.</i>

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.450
<i>Steroids.</i>

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:11.670
<i>A medicine with powerful anti-inflammatory
and immunosuppressive effects.</i>

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:15.340
<i>Highly effective in suppressing
allergic reactions.</i>

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:20.800
<i>In the case of spot balding,
steroids suppress cytokine-secreting T Cells.</i>

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:24.310
Back off!
Why should we be eliminated?

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:27.810
After all we've done for this body!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.060
Now eliminating.

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:39.990
Let me go!
Don't get in the way of my work!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.200
Let me go!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.700
Everyone, that way! Please deliver
that oxygen now while you can!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.410
Let me go! I'm going to eliminate
all foreign substances!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.540
It's up to us to get it done!
It's up to us!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.420
Hey! It's dangerous to go near him!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:59.550
Killer T Cell...

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.380
That's enough.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:05.600
You don't have to work anymore.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.810
Don't have to work?

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:14.650
You've already worked more than enough
to protect this world.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:19.070
There's no one
who would ever fault you for that.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.700
Is that right?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.950
So, I don't have to work anymore, huh?

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:36.420
I don't... have to work any...

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.520
<i>I believed that if I gave it my all
and worked like crazy...</i>

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:56.060
<i>then this deplorable,
code black environment would get better.</i>

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:00.070
Wh-What happened to me?

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:04.280
<i>But is that really true, I wonder.</i>

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:14.710
WHITE BLOOD CELL

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.540
All right.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:14.710
Did you hear about the spot balding incident
with hair loss from the crown?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.500
Yeah, I heard.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:21.300
The T Cells went bonkers from overwork and
started assaulting the Hair Matrix Cells, right?

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:26.430
Seriously, what's going to happen to this body?

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:30.140
Run!

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.600
There's something in the urinary tract!

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.060
The urine...

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:44.360
It's turning bright red!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.410
<i>Where is this world heading?</i>

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.380
PREVIEW

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:21.380
This is the organ of silence.

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:25.090
No matter what the conditions,
you have to work without a word.

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:24.380
KIDNEYS

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:27.260
A one-centimeter stone...

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:26.550
KIDNEY STONES

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:28.260
What are we supposed to do?

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:31.050
What's wrong with complaining?

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:30.220
TEARS

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.970
Just listen to what they're trying to say!

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.970
KIDNEYS, KIDNEY STONES, AND TEARS
